// MiniBankDrillMinutes  (category: MiniBank Look-ahead; parameters: since:datetime)
// MiniBankDrillMinutes(since:datetime) - Look-ahead v1.0 helper: every minute (UTC, 1-minute bins) covered by a drill window
// after 'since'. Join with kind=leftanti on T = bin(TimeGenerated, 1m) to leave drills out.
MiniBankDrills()
| where DrillEnd > since
| extend T = range(bin(DrillStart, 1m), DrillEnd, 1m)
| mv-expand T to typeof(datetime)
| distinct T
